# Workspace Venv Sync

When adding dependencies to any repo's pyproject.toml, ALWAYS install at BOTH levels:

1. **Repo level**: `cd repo && uv pip install -e .`  (no extras — flat deps only)
2. **Workspace level**: `cd $WORKSPACE_ROOT && source .venv-workspace/bin/activate && uv pip install package-name`

**FLAT DEPS RULE**: All repos use a single `[project.dependencies]` list. There is no
`[project.optional-dependencies]` in any repo. Never use `.[dev]`, `.[test]`, or any extra.

This ensures IDE health (Pylance, type checking) works across the workspace.

