**Rename:** `unified-order-interface` → `unified-trade-execution-interface`

**Install order** (dependency order for workspace venv IDE type hints):

```bash
cd $WORKSPACE_ROOT  # or /path/to/unified-trading-system-repos
source .venv-workspace/bin/activate

# 1. matching-engine-library (no deps on other local libs)
uv pip install -e matching-engine-library

# 2. unified-trade-execution-interface (was unified-order-interface)
#    If version constraints fail: pip install -e unified-trade-execution-interface --no-deps
pip install -e unified-trade-execution-interface --no-deps

# 3. unified-defi-execution-interface
uv pip install -e unified-defi-execution-interface

# 4. execution-algo-library
uv pip install -e execution-algo-library

# 5. Re-install execution-service to pick up new deps
pip install -e execution-service --no-deps
```

**Uninstall old:** `uv pip uninstall unified-order-interface` (no longer exists)

